/* CRC32-C (Castagnoli), reflected form.
 * Normal poly 0x1EDC6F41, reflected poly 0x82F63B78.
 * init 0xFFFFFFFF, xorout 0xFFFFFFFF.
 * Check value: CRC32-C("123456789") == 0xE3069283.
 * Table generated by: crc = (crc >> 1) ^ ((crc & 1) ? 0x82F63B78 : 0)
 * for i in 0..255 over 8 bits; verified against the check value above.
 *
 * Three interchangeable back ends, all bit-identical:
 *   - SSE4.2 `crc32` instruction (x86-64, selected at run time)
 *   - slice-by-8 tables (portable fast software path)
 *   - slice-by-1 table (reference / tail handling)
 */

